  "details": "Official Client: Steam \n\nApp ID: 438100 \n\nBuild ID: 19251301\n\nA number of VRChat users have reported that the game is running significantly slower. Worlds that would normally run comfortably at 60 fps have dropped to 15 fps or less, greatly impairing the comfort of the game.\n\nWhen launched from Steam, the client can be launched and logged in normally, but it is very slow; when the launch pad (menu UI) is opened, the frame rate drops even further, to less than 10 fps, and performance drops to almost unusable. The performance drops to almost unusable.\n\nWe urge the developers to reduce unnecessary resources and streamline the game so that it can be used comfortably with specs that meet Windows 11 spec requirements.\n\n*This problem occurs only with the Windows version of VRChat.",
